Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.95,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(478,1)\fs66\fnVerdana\c&H1F2029&\3c&HF0F0F0&\bord6\b0\pos(960,414)}20 de junho
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.95,0:01:39.73,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Sim, certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.93,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Sim, claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:44.83,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Vamos mandar isso ainda hoje à noite!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:50.86,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Sim, sentimos muito. \NEsperamos que continue—
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.59,0:02:00.24,DefaultItalics,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Ele não podia ter feito uma transição \Ntranquila das tarefas antes de viajar?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.48,FlashbackItalics,CHIEF,0,0,0,,Tchau. Segurem as pontas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.48,Default,SUZUKI,0,0,0,,Isso foi tão do nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:06.62,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,E ele ainda está no exterior, pra piorar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:10.85,Default,ROOKIE,0,0,0,,Sasaki-san, sinto muito! \NEsqueci um dos orçamentos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.85,0:02:13.83,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Ligue pro cliente e avise primeiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:15.36,Default,MID,0,0,0,,Desculpa, Sasaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:19.26,Default,MID,0,0,0,,O Itou-kun, que entrou esse ano, \Nsumiu sem avisar. O que eu faço?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:21.90,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,O quê? Ele não estava \Nresponsável por uns documentos?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.12,Default,MID,0,0,0,,Pois é. Ele até \Nlevou eles pra casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:30.25,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Entendi. Vou até a casa dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.71,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Manda o endereço dele por mensagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:32.86,Default,MID,0,0,0,,Pode deixar!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:44.02,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs48\bord6\c&HF9F9FD&\3c&HBE7B31&\fax-0.15\frz9.03\pos(1357.5,234)\t(1392,1517,\3c&H96622A&\c&HC0C3C2&)\t(1642,1809,\c&HF9F9FD&\3c&HBE7B31&)}Enviar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:44.02,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b0\fs48\bord6\c&H9C9D9E&\3c&HECECE9&\fax-0.15\frz9.03\pos(1767,160.5)}Orçamento...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:58.78,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Ah, droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.41,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,106)\fs51\an7\fnVerdana\c&HF8F6F6&\3c&H2E2D2B&\b0\pos(400.5,357)}Bloquear\N\N\NSuspender\N\N\NDesligar\N\N\NReiniciar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.02,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Até amanhã.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.79,DefaultItalics,PA,0,0,0,,Agradecemos a sua paciência.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:12.09,DefaultItalics,PA,0,0,0,,O último trem para Shimaida está partindo \Nda plataforma número 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:23.36,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Argh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:31.44,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs30\b0\frz17.35\pos(543,678)}Alarme
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:31.44,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord6\fs27\b0\frz17.35\pos(571.5,760.5)\3c&H3443AD&}Soneca
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.81,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord6\fs24\b0\frz17.35\3c&H676767&\pos(601.5,849)}Parar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.20,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(315,1)\fs66\fnVerdana\c&H1F2029&\3c&HF0F0F0&\bord6\b0\pos(960,414)}21 de junho
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:49.34,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:58.08,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Droga, acabou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.92,DefaultItalics,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Hoje, preciso fazer um formulário de pedido,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:07.28,DefaultItalics,SASAKI,0,0,0,,ir cumprimentar um novo fornecedor, e depois...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:09.60,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,Com licença, Sasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:13.17,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,Um familiar meu \Ndesmaiou e foi internado...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.97,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Ah, tudo bem. Vá vê-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:18.43,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Se tiver algum trabalho urgente, \Neu cuido disso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:20.80,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.48,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,Alô? Sim, já estou indo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:24.74,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:31.64,Default,WEMPLOYEE,0,0,0,,É tudo isso aqui. \NDesculpa deixar isso com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:36.25,Default,MID,0,0,0,,Sasaki-san, desculpa, mas o Itou-kun \Ntambém não veio hoje.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.39,Default,MID,0,0,0,,O que eu faço?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.13,Default,MID,0,0,0,,Sasaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:45.64,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(519,1)\fs30\b0\frz17.35\pos(543,678)}Alarme
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:45.64,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(519,1)\bord6\fs27\b0\frz17.35\pos(571.5,760.5)\3c&H3443AD&}Soneca
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:45.14,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(519,1)\bord6\fs24\b0\frz17.35\3c&H676767&\pos(601.5,849)}Parar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.64,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fs66\fnVerdana\c&H1F2029&\3c&HF0F0F0&\bord6\b0\pos(960,414)}22 de junho
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:05.88,Default,SUZUKI,0,0,0,,Sasaki! Eu não aguento mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:09.81,Default,SASAKI,0,0,0,,Você está indo muito bem, cara. \NContinue assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:10.58,Default,SUZUKI,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:16.42,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs30\b0\frz17.35\pos(543,678)}Alarme
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:16.42,Signs,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord6\fs27\b0\frz17.35\pos(571.5,760.5)\3c&H3443AD&}Soneca
